# Large Language Models (LLMs)

## Project Overview

This project explores Large Language Models (LLMs), including prompt engineering, text generation, reasoning, retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), and modern AI applications.

## Objectives

- Understand transformer-based models
- Practice prompt engineering
- Build Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) systems
- Explore AI reasoning capabilities
- Integrate LLMs into real-world applications

## Technologies

- Python
- OpenAI API
- Hugging Face Transformers
- LangChain
- FAISS
- Google Colab
- Jupyter Notebook

## Applications

- AI Chatbots
- Document Question Answering
- Code Generation
- Knowledge Assistants
- Content Generation
- AI Automation

